            {
              "content": "=Write a LinkedIn-ready post about {{$json[\"topic\"]}}.\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n1) Use Unicode bold characters (𝗹𝗶𝗸𝗲 𝘁𝗵𝗶𝘀) instead of Markdown (*bold*).\n2) No asterisks, no markdown, no quotation marks, and no code blocks in the output.\n3) Structure:\n   - 𝗛𝗲𝗮𝗱𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗲 in Unicode bold + one relevant emoji.\n   - Blank line.\n   - 2–3 sentence engaging introduction giving context.\n   - Blank line.\n   - 📈 𝗦𝗵𝗼𝗿𝘁 𝗦𝘂𝗯𝗵𝗲𝗮𝗱 𝟭 (Unicode bold) — one-sentence summary + 1–2 short explanatory sentences.\n   - Blank line.\n   - 🌍 𝗦𝗵𝗼𝗿𝘁 𝗦𝘂𝗯𝗵𝗲𝗮𝗱 𝟮 (Unicode bold) — one-sentence summary + 1–2 short explanatory sentences.\n   - Blank line.\n   - 🧠 𝗦𝗵𝗼𝗿𝘁 𝗦𝘂𝗯𝗵𝗲𝗮𝗱 𝟯 (Unicode bold) — one-sentence summary + 1–2 short explanatory sentences.\n   - Blank line.\n   - 1–2 sentence closing with a call-to-action or question.\n   - Blank line.\n   - 6–8 relevant hashtags in TitleCase, separated by spaces (e.g., #StockMarket #Investing #Innovation).\n\nSTYLE:\n- Professional yet conversational tone.\n- Short, skimmable paragraphs.\n- Keep the total length under 1,400 characters.\n- Make it visually easy to read in LinkedIn’s feed."
            }
          ]
